{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/1166","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/1166/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/1166/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/1166/events","html_url":"https://github.com/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/1166","id":6267763537,"node_id":"I_kwDORhCjFc8AAAABdZZ7UQ","number":1166,"title":"Reconcile duplicate NBRC1257 and NBRC1321 stock proposals before integration","user":{"login":"realmarcin","id":4625870,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2MjU4NzA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4625870?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin","html_url":"https://github.com/realmarcin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-11-08T04:56:01Z","updated_at":"2026-11-08T05:17:05Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"The frozen Worker 1 shard proposes four new owners for two equivalent preparations. This concerns unpublished proposals; no maintained owners have been merged or changed.\n\n| Preparation | Proposals | Primary evidence |\n|---|---|---|\n| CO2-saturated bicarbonate | `NSC-PROP-NBRC_1257_Bicarbonate_Solution` and `CS-PROP-NBRC1321_CO2_BICARBONATE_STOCK` | Both sources specify 8.4 g NaHCO3 plus 100 mL distilled water, CO2 saturation, sealed CO2 bottles and autoclaving. |\n| Sulfide from nonahydrate | `NSC-PROP-NBRC_1257_Sulfide_Solution` and `CS-PROP-NBRC1321_SULFIDE_STOCK` | NBRC1257 uses 12 g Na2S·9H2O plus 50 mL water; NBRC1321 uses 24 g plus 100 mL. Both are nominally 1 M, filter sterilized and stored under N2. The batch scales differ by two; the evidence does not establish distinct preparations. |\n\nPrimary pages: [NBRC1257](https://www.nite.go.jp/nbrc/catalogue/NBRCMediumDetailServlet?NO=1257) and [NBRC1321](https://www.nite.go.jp/nbrc/catalogue/NBRCMediumDetailServlet?NO=1321). Exact captures and payloads are bound in the finding below.\n\nReconcile each pair to one proposed owner while preserving both source cases, every occurrence, raw labels, original batch scales and receiving-medium amounts. Source numbers alone do not define distinct substances. This does not establish equivalence with generic 84 g/L bicarbonate, neutralized sulfide or 5% sulfide. Preserve added-water amounts without asserting measured final volume; keep generic source-local labels non-resolving. The author/coordinator must select the retained proposal; this issue selects no identifier and authorizes no maintained-owner merge.\n\nThe same-source phenanthrene and Metal44 pairs were already reported by the worker and remain separate reconciliation items. Current open-issue deduplication found no tracker for these two cross-source pairs; #1163 concerns the earlier stock-completeness gap.\n\nEvidence under `.temp/all-unmatched-20261107/preflight/w01-shard-coordinator-review-v2/`: `finding-003-duplicate-preparations.json`, SHA256 `8395d68231535cb509d7fef4b1d1ad3405498c50fc71d9e9ce259c5219749261`; peer `duplicate-addendum-v1/comparison.json`, SHA256 `1efe59deafe86709301536500ac9a885ab9b2d793144591c1b3ab8c92a573a26`. Frozen proposal manifest SHA256 `eb456ecef3f68b587a2f0281336f88b33679eb8d65a38f842661457ec05866f0`.\n\nRequire native validation and independent re-review of the reconciled final payloads. No role, component, mapping-release or whole-record approval follows from this issue.\n","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/1166/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/1166/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}